<title>USA: Concordia Paper says oversupply continue.</title>
<headline>Concordia Paper says oversupply continue.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Concordia Paper Holdings Ltd said on Wednesday that selling prices remained stable throughout the quarter although oversupply and keen competition in the boxboard market from overseas continues.</p>
<p>The company said that the local boxboard market presents a challenge. Chief Executive and Managing Director Joseph Lau said, &quot;We have been able to capitalize on the company's local advantages and achieve a positive result.&quot;</p>
<p>(( --New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.))</p>
